This product bundles, unmodified, XML schemas (XSD) and stylesheets (XSLT)
published by the Servicio de Administración Tributaria (SAT) of Mexico, and
uses SAT public test certificates in its test suite. The module cfdi4j-catalogs
contains data extracted from the SAT catalog file catCFDI_V_4_<date>.xls. Their origin, publication
date and SHA-256 are listed in specs/SOURCES.md.

This product depends on Saxon-HE (https://www.saxonica.com/), licensed under
the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0, and on XML Resolver
(https://xmlresolver.org/), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
